WEBVTT

00:12:57.773 --> 00:13:00.651
You can volunteer your time for homework,

00:13:00.692 --> 00:13:02.903
there's so much you can do
in your own country.

00:13:02.945 --> 00:13:06.573
Don't think that Africa is just
the country where we need help.

00:13:06.573 --> 00:13:08.116
We don't need help.

00:13:08.116 --> 00:13:09.827
We need collaboration."

00:13:10.869 --> 00:13:13.205
FO: Did you warm up your voice today?

00:13:13.497 --> 00:13:14.790
AK: Yes, I did.

00:13:15.874 --> 00:13:21.421
FO: What do you sing to yourself
to cheer yourself up?

00:13:21.421 --> 00:13:22.923
What do you sing and is like,

00:13:22.923 --> 00:13:25.801
"Oh, that was better than Prozac."

00:13:26.677 --> 00:13:30.722
AK: (Singing)